The first Mac build of Another Morse Trainer: the same app as on the iPhone, in a resizable Mac window.
• Every mode, drill and game, with the Mac keyboard for typed answers and quiz choices.
• USB MIDI keys and the Vail Adapter work as on the iPhone. A Bluetooth MIDI key is paired in Audio MIDI Setup (Window › Show MIDI Studio › Bluetooth); the app's Bluetooth key button shows the steps.
• Listen & Learn keeps playing with the window in the background.
• The leaderboard may be read-only on the Mac if it cannot attest.
Please try: a choice quiz with the keyboard, Sending Practice with a key, Listen & Learn, and resizing the window. Tell us about anything that looks wrong or sounds wrong.
